		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7185027130B5CEB3"]
			description: ["Where the wire cutters take a plate and make one wire, the wiremill takes an ingot and makes two wires. It also lets you make Fine Wire more efficiently, which will be important. You should hang onto your wire cutters though, as they're how you set cable connections."]
			id: "0BB0E037CCD762AE"
