		{
			dependencies: ["11E81C722A7FE539"]
			description: ["Once you have some excess oxygen, you can use it in the Arc Furnace to make Wrought Iron and Annealed Copper easier. You can also turn Sand directly into Glass with this machine, at a much more efficient rate."]
