			description: [
				"Some machine recipes take 'programmed circuits'. These are not actual items that must be input into the machine."
				""
				"Instead, most LV+ machines have a box in the bottom left of their GUI, where clicking opens a menu of different programmed circuit numbers. The value set may be changed at any time. "
